addPat("TOU", "Three Outside Up", 34, 3, 1, 2, 73, "|H4|D1|", "Reversal", 3,
      "A bullish engulfing plus a confirmation candle: the affirmed version of the market's best-known bullish reversal.",
      "Prior downtrend. Candles 1-2 form a bullish engulfing. Candle 3 is bullish and closes above candle 2's close.",
      "Below the low of the engulfing candle.",
