addPat("TOD", "Three Outside Down", 35, 3, -1, 2, 73, "|H4|D1|", "Reversal", 3,
      "A bearish engulfing plus a confirmation candle — an affirmed downside reversal.",
      "Prior uptrend. Candles 1-2 form a bearish engulfing. Candle 3 is bearish and closes below candle 2's close.",
      "Above the high of the engulfing candle.",
      "Nearest support, then the swing low.",
