addPat("R3M", "Rising Three Methods", 36, 3, 1, 2, 72, "|H4|D1|", "Continuation", 5,
      "A pause inside an uptrend: a big green candle, three small candles drifting back but staying inside its range, then another big green candle breaking to new highs. The trend simply took a breath.",
      "Candle 1 a long bullish body. Candles 2-4 small bodies (mostly bearish) that all stay inside candle 1's range. Candle 5 bullish, closing above candle 1's high.",
      "Below the lowest point of the three resting candles.",
