addPat("F3M", "Falling Three Methods", 37, 3, -1, 2, 72, "|H4|D1|", "Continuation", 5,
      "A pause inside a downtrend: a big red candle, three small candles drifting up inside its range, then another big red candle breaking to new lows.",
      "Candle 1 a long bearish body. Candles 2-4 small bodies (mostly bullish) inside candle 1's range. Candle 5 bearish, closing below candle 1's low.",
      "Above the highest point of the three resting candles.",
      "A measured move equal to candle 1's range projected down from the breakdown.",
