addPat("BKA", "Breakaway (Bullish)", 38, 3, 1, 3, 66, "|D1|", "Reversal", 5,
      "Sellers running out of breath: a long red candle, a red candle separating below it, two more weak declining candles, then a strong green candle that reclaims all of the fall back to the separation zone.",
      "Candle 1 a long bearish body. Candle 2 bearish and separated below it. Candles 3-4 continue lower with weakening bodies. Candle 5 a long bullish candle closing back inside the separation zone but below candle 1's body.",
      "Below the lowest low of the five candles.",
      "Candle 1's body top — that is where the pattern was born.",
