addPat("LDB", "Ladder Bottom", 39, 3, 1, 3, 65, "|D1|", "Reversal", 5,
      "A broken ladder: three consecutive declining red candles, a fourth red candle that finally shows a meaningful upper shadow (the first buying attempt), then a green candle that opens above the whole previous body.",
      "Candles 1-3 bearish with progressively lower opens and closes. Candle 4 bearish with a clear upper shadow. Candle 5 bullish, opening above candle 4's body and closing above its high.",
      "Below the lowest low of the pattern.",
