addPat("CBS", "Concealing Baby Swallow", 40, 3, 1, 3, 67, "|D1|", "Reversal", 4,
      "A small swallow hidden inside a big red candle. Seller panic peaks and is instantly absorbed: two long declining reds, a third red separating lower whose upper shadow reaches back into candle 2, then a fourth big red candle that completely engulfs the third.",
      "Candles 1-2 long bearish (marubozu-like) with candle 2 closing lower. Candle 3 bearish, opening below candle 2's body with a high that reaches back inside candle 2's body. Candle 4 bearish, engulfing the whole of candle 3.",
      "Below candle 4's low.",
      "Nearest resistance — this pattern often begins sharp short squeezes.",
      "All four candles are red, so direction comes only from context. Never enter before a fifth BULLISH candle confirms above candle 4's high.")
addPat("U3R", "Unique Three River", 41, 3, 1, 3, 62, "|D1|", "Reversal", 3,
      "A big red candle, then a hammer-like red candle that digs to a new low but closes back up inside, then a small green candle that locks the base without exceeding the previous close.",
      "Candle 1 a long bearish body. Candle 2 bearish with a new low, a long lower shadow and a body inside candle 1's body. Candle 3 a small bullish candle whose close stays below candle 2's close.",
      "Below candle 2's low (the river bed).",
      "Candle 1's body top; scale out early, this pattern gives modest targets.",
